# Health Dashboard — Project Overview

## Project
Personal health dashboard connected to Garmin Connect.

## Stack
- **Frontend**: Next.js 14, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend**: FastAPI, Python 3.12, uv

## Color System
Midnight Terminal palette with custom Tailwind tokens — always use these, never raw hex:
- `bg-background-card` — card backgrounds
- `text-accent-green` — positive metrics, active states
- `text-accent-coral` — warnings, elevated values
- `text-accent-blue` — informational, neutral metrics

## Component Architecture
- `components/dashboard/` — dashboard-specific: `MetricCard`, `SectionPanel`, `VO2MaxChart`
- `components/ui/` — generic, reusable UI primitives

## API
- Frontend calls FastAPI backend via `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
- Backend fetches data from Garmin Connect

## Auth
- Garmin credentials stored in `backend/.env`
- Tokens cached in `.secrets/garmin/`

## Package Management
- Frontend: `npm`
- Backend: `uv`
